    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Chief Librarian Mephiston",
    "summary": "This is a level 2 psychic ability. As [your opponent's Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) begins, you can roll a D6 for this unit as a [psychic roll](vsdata:core-rule/psychic-abilities), unless it is **[battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)**. On a 1, the unit becomes **battle-shocked**. Whatever the result, whenever an enemy unit up to 6\" from this unit makes its **[fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)**, it has to make a **[leadership roll](vsdata:core-rule/leadership-rolls)** and, on a fail, **[Remain Stationary](vsdata:core-rule/remain-stationary)**.",
